1. THAT Council confirni its interest in participating in a joint feasibility study with other
             local and federal departments for a new overhead transit cable car gondola from
             Colwood
             to Esquimalt over Esqujmalt Harbour;

             2. AND THAT Council budget $20,000 for its share of this study in 2022;

             3. AND THATstaff consult Colwood and Esquimalt on the proposal.
